Runtime evidence preparation, candidate09 and successors

This directory is owned by the independent runtime/evidence reviewer. The tools
here only read existing frozen source and completed receipts and write new audit
artifacts. They never execute Swift, tests, codecs, servers, Git, or publication.
Native execution belongs exclusively to root.

Current preparation does not qualify candidate09. Its focused run exited1 with
